# Code-owner lock on the CI-gate files. With "Require review from Code Owners"
# enabled in branch protection, a PR touching these paths needs code-owner
# approval before merge.
#
# NOTE: a PR opened by the sole code owner BYPASSES this gate (GitHub does not
# require self-review) — so on a single-maintainer repo this is defense-in-depth
# (it locks the paths against OTHER contributors), not a hard gate on the owner.
/.github/       @putmanj00
/.gitleaks.toml @putmanj00
